<h1>Build a conference bridge with VoiceML.</h1>
<p class="lede">Jurassic Park runs a fictional incident bridge. The control room opens it by calling in, park staff who call first wait on hold until it starts, visitors can listen without being heard, and the bridge closes for everyone when the control room hangs up. It is one document published on voiceml.org, with no application server.</p>
