<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Limits of this design</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Anyone who calls can join as staff.</strong> There is no code to get in. To require one, add the check from the <a href="/support/voiceml/build-a-pin-protected-line-with-voiceml/">PIN-protected line example</a> before the staff branch.</li>
		<li><strong>The control room must call from a listed number.</strong> Calling from any other phone joins as staff, and the bridge won&rsquo;t start.</li>
		<li><strong>One room.</strong> Every call joins <code>isla-nublar-incident</code>. A second, simultaneous incident needs a second room name.</li>
		<li><strong>Not recorded.</strong> Add <code>record="record-from-start"</code> to the control room&rsquo;s <code>&lt;Conference&gt;</code> to record the bridge; recording stops when the control room leaves.</li>
	</ul>
</section>

